{"hymn":"S56","parent":"E71","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"¡Jesús! Tu nombre al escuchar","subtitle":"Alabanza al Señor—Su nombre","syl":{"n1":["¡Je","i"],"n2":["sús!","t"],"n4":"Tu","n5":["nom","i"],"n7":["bre‿al","t"],"n8":["es","i"],"n9":["cu","m"],"n10":["char,","t"],"n11":["Des","i"],"n12":["plie","m"],"n14":["ga","t"],"n15":"Tu","n16":["vir","i"],"n17":["tud;","t"],"n18":"Al","n19":["per","i"],"n21":["do","m"],"n22":["na","m"],"n23":["do","t"],"n24":["pe","i"],"n26":["ca","m"],"n27":["dor","t"],"n28":"No‿hay","n29":["o","i"],"n31":["tro","t"],"n32":["co","i"],"n33":["mo","t"],"n34":"Tú."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Tu nombre‿encierra todo bien,","En Ti Dios se mostró.","En Ti logró Dios expresar","Su vida‿aquí, Señor."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Jesús: es nombre de amor,","De pena‿y sumisión;","Tu compasión anula‿en mi","Toda lamentación."]},{"label":"4.","lines":["Jesús, quien sin pecado es,","Pecado hecho fue;","Justificándonos ganó","Nuestro amor y fe."]},{"label":"5.","lines":["Tu nombre‿evoca‿adoración","En nuestro corazón;","El principal entre diez mil,","Tu‿amor nos libertó."]}]}